### Create a queue: two Uzbek-speaking operators and one Russian-speaking, position announced every minute
POST http://localhost:8080/api/call-queues
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Sotuv bo'limi",
  "strategy": "SKILL_BASED",
  "ringTimeoutSec": 15,
  "wrapUpSec": 10,
  "maxWaitSec": 300,
  "announcePositionEverySec": 60,
  "announceWaitTime": true,
  "periodicAnnounceText": "Qo'ng'irog'ingiz biz uchun muhim. Iltimos, kuting.",
  "periodicAnnounceEverySec": 120,
  "callbackOfferAfterSec": 90,
  "overflowAction": "CALLBACK",
  "serviceLevelSec": 20,
  "postCallSurvey": true,
  "autoCallback": true,
  "members": [
    { "userId": 2, "priority": 0, "skills": ["uz-UZ"] },
    { "userId": 3, "priority": 0, "skills": ["uz-UZ", "ru-RU"] },
    { "userId": 4, "priority": 10, "skills": ["ru-RU"] }
  ]
}

### List queues
POST http://localhost:8080/api/call-queues/list
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{ "page": 0, "size": 20 }

### Live state of every queue (waiting callers, operators by status)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/call-queues/live
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
